# 054 · Signed receipts and images

**Status:** `PROPOSED` · **Version:** [later](../roadmap.md#later)

## What

Signed judge receipts, SBOMs, image signatures and build provenance.

## Why

Results and images should be checkable by people who do not trust the machine that made them.

## Done when

- [ ] Receipts and images verify with a published key.

